Aqua: implement D3DKMTOpenAdapterFromHdc.

Wine only had a stub that returned STATUS_NO_MEMORY. Need for Speed: The Run looks for NVAPI and AMD
ADL first, then falls back to this call; with the stub it quits with "Could Not Get Primary Adapter
Handle". Opens the adapter driving the primary display, like D3DKMTOpenAdapterFromGdiDisplayName.

